    takeaway: `Self-attention buys O(1) information path length between any two sequence positions — that is the property RNNs cannot replicate without exponential gradient attenuation. The price is O(n²) memory. Every efficient Transformer variant is a different strategy for paying less for that direct connectivity.`,
